# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore -- official-statistics production repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# For: DW sector pipelines (DW-Production and siblings), SDMX /
# data.unicef.org publication pipelines, survey-processing repos.
#
# Template from unicef-drp/cso-toolkit: templates/gitignore/official-stats.gitignore
# Guidance: docs/gitignore_guidelines.md. For papers and analysis projects
# use templates/gitignore/research-project.gitignore instead.
#
# Pipeline outputs are deposited to the canonical Teams / Z: store by
# dw_save(); the repo holds code, vendored helpers (00_functions/), the
# manifest, and the provenance sidecars of inputs kept out of git.
# Check after copying:  git ls-files -i -c --exclude-standard  (prints nothing)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- 1. Input folders anywhere (e.g. 02_consultations/023_targets/inputs) --
# Folders are re-included (`!**/inputs/**/`) because git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded; then only these files come back.
**/inputs/**
!**/inputs/**/
!**/inputs/**/README.md
!**/inputs/**/.gitkeep
!**/inputs/**/*.provenance.json
!**/inputs/**/input_manifest.*

# ---- 2. API cache and frozen downloads --------------------------------------
_apis/**
!_apis/**/
!_apis/**/README.md
!_apis/**/.gitkeep
!_apis/**/*.provenance.json
_frozen/**
!_frozen/**/
!_frozen/**/README.md
!_frozen/**/.gitkeep
!_frozen/**/*.provenance.json

# ---- 3. Data formats, wherever they appear ----------------------------------
*.sav
*.dta
*.rds
*.RData
*.rda
*.parquet
*.feather
*.sas7bdat
*.zip
*.7z
*.gz

# ---- 4. Secrets and personal configuration ---------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.Renviron
user_config.yml
# The placeholder template stays tracked:
!_config_template/user_config.yml

# ---- 5. Logs and language noise ---------------------------------------------
*.log
*.smcl
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
renv/library/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/

# ---- 6. OS and editors -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
.idea/
.vscode/
